  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "time": 18.16,
      "text": "在東京鐵塔 第一次眺望",
      "nearest_beat": 18.088345,
      "beat_delta": -0.071655
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "time": 26.77,
      "text": "看燈火模仿 墜落的星光",
      "nearest_beat": 26.656508,
      "beat_delta": -0.113492
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "time": 35.27,
      "text": "我終於到達 但卻更悲傷",
      "nearest_beat": 35.224671,
      "beat_delta": -0.045329
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "time": 43.88,
      "text": "一個人完成 我們的夢想",
      "nearest_beat": 43.769615,
      "beat_delta": -0.110385
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "time": 50.56,
      "text": "你總說 時間還很多 你可以等我",
      "nearest_beat": 50.735601,
      "beat_delta": 0.175601
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "time": 59.17,
      "text": "以前我不懂得 未必明天 就有以後",
      "nearest_beat": 59.326984,
      "beat_delta": 0.156984
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "time": 67.58,
      "text": "想念是會呼吸的痛",
      "nearest_beat": 67.314649,
      "beat_delta": -0.265351
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "time": 71.73,
      "text": "它活在我身上所有角落",
      "nearest_beat": 71.65678,
      "beat_delta": -0.07322
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "time": 76.31,
      "text": "哼你愛的歌會痛 看你的信會痛",
      "nearest_beat": 76.463311,
      "beat_delta": 0.153311
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "time": 81.38,
      "text": "連沉默也痛",
      "nearest_beat": 81.293061,
      "beat_delta": -0.086939
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "time": 84.85,
      "text": "遺憾是會呼吸的痛",
      "nearest_beat": 85.031474,
      "beat_delta": 0.181474
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "time": 88.87,
      "text": "它流在血液中來回滾動",
      "nearest_beat": 88.793107,
      "beat_delta": -0.076893
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "time": 93.38,
      "text": "後悔不貼心會痛 恨不懂你會痛",
      "nearest_beat": 93.599637,
      "beat_delta": 0.219637
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "time": 98.44,
      "text": "想見不能見最痛",
      "nearest_beat": 98.429388,
      "beat_delta": -0.010612
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "time": 123.18,
      "text": "沒看你臉上 張揚過哀傷",
      "nearest_beat": 123.06576,
      "beat_delta": -0.11424
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "time": 131.74,
      "text": "那是種多麼 寂寞的倔強",
      "nearest_beat": 131.633923,
      "beat_delta": -0.106077
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "time": 140.24,
      "text": "你拆了城牆 讓我去流浪",
      "nearest_beat": 140.225306,
      "beat_delta": -0.014694
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "time": 148.88,
      "text": "在原地等我 把自己綑綁",
      "nearest_beat": 148.793469,
      "beat_delta": -0.086531
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "time": 155.54,
      "text": "你沒說 你也會軟弱 需要倚賴我",
      "nearest_beat": 155.759456,
      "beat_delta": 0.219456
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "time": 164.17000000000002,
      "text": "我就裝不曉得 自由移動 自我地過",
      "nearest_beat": 164.327619,
      "beat_delta": 0.157619
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "time": 172.65,
      "text": "想念是會呼吸的痛",
      "nearest_beat": 172.895782,
      "beat_delta": 0.245782
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "time": 176.7,
      "text": "它活在我身上所有角落",
      "nearest_beat": 176.657415,
      "beat_delta": -0.042585
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
